    "description": "About screen: open source section title"
  },
  "openSourceBody": "Jekyll Press is open source under the MIT License. Found a bug or have a feature request? Head over to GitHub to:\n\n• Report issues\n• Request features\n• Contribute code\n• Star the repo ⭐",
